WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:36.100
The Messenger From Axis

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.880
So it <i>is</i> the Gwadan from Axis.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.880
You mean the remnants of Zeon had
constructed this tremendous battleship...

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.630
...in the asteroid belt?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.490
It's because the Federation
Government lost interest...

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:25.190
...in outer space after the war.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:28.670
They've steadily increased their forces
over time...

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:30.370
...just like us A.E.U.G..

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.270
The launch is now ready.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:35.080
Let's go, Mr. Wong.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.270
Wait, Kamille!

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.740
Kamille!

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.440
Where are Shinta and Qum?

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.920
Why must you also board
the enemy's battleship, Kamille?

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.280
They're Captain Bright's orders.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.750
You're too preoccupied
with Ensign Reccoa!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.520
Not at all!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.810
<i>They will indicate where to board</i>
<i>their ship with light signals.</i>

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:07.840
Roger.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.510
Are they trying to annoy us on purpose?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.110
Who are these people, anyway?!

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.850
They're just acting tough!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.910
<i>Could that be...?!</i>

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.340
It is.
It's Haman Karn.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:52.250
Who is that woman?

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.880
- Kamille.
- Oh, sorry.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.650
I'm Wong Lee.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.890
I've come as the A.E.U.G.'s representative.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:41.870
I request to meet
with your chief representative.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:43.840
Let me introduce you.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.970
<i>This is no doubt the Zabi Family.</i>

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.230
<i>Don't these people realize that</i>
<i>times have changed?</i>

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:25.240
The legitimate successor of the Zabis!
I introduce to you, Princess Mineva Zabi!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:29.380
Mineva?!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.480
- A child?
- Apolly!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.920
<i>How could they name her</i>
<i>their leader at such a young age?</i>

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:44.690
<i>This child was brought up within the</i>
<i>asteroid belt following the fall of Zeon.</i>

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:48.930
<i>And now she's leaving Axis</i>
<i>to return to the Earth Sphere.</i>

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:54.970
We won't get anywhere talking to a child.
Our focus should be on that woman.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.910
Miss Haman Karn.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.810
The man with the sunglasses.
Please approach Miss Mineva.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.580
Approach Miss Mineva!

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.840
I knew it! You're Char Aznable!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.250
Do they know each other that well?

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.280
Char?!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.710
Quattro Bajeena.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.780
What the hell!

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:39.120
You haven't changed one bit.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.090
It's great to see you again.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.450
I remember playing with you very clearly.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:47.360
You remember what happened
when you were only two?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:55.440
I commend you on your
years of intelligence work.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.740
The time has come for Axis
to make its move.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.670
I request that you assist us
in reviving the Zabi Family.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:07.210
True prosperity for Spacenoids
depends on the revival of Zeon.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.810
Zeon Deikun's...!

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:14.020
Please continue, Miss Mineva.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.190
Char Aznable!

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.190
How dare you bring up Mineva
to become like this!

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:22.360
Why are you raising her into such a
narrow-minded person?!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.960
As the successor of the Zabi Family...

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:29.030
...Miss Mineva is destined to become
leader of all Spacenoids!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:33.000
Her ways of thinking are proper and
suitable to her own status.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:36.010
I believe perhaps it is you
who has had a change of heart.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:36.910
Haman!

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.950
Out of my way!

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:44.850
Stop it, Lieutenant Quattro!

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:47.550
It's no use taking any action here!

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.620
Let go!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.090
You're in the presence of Miss Mineva.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.430
I cannot allow such rudeness!

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:58.230
Haman.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.900
We're stuck in here without the chance
to negotiate...

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.570
...all thanks to you, Lieutenant.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.210
Mr. Wong!

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.880
- Kamille.
- Yes?

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.080
I want to get out of this room.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.490
Give me a hand.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.060
I dare you to repeat what you said,
Kamille!

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:39.370
Y-You only think of yourself...
A-And you're a coward!

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:40.070
Kamille!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.070
How dare you!

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:42.700
Stop it, Lieutenant!

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.110
What in the world's the matter?!

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:45.640
Are you all right, Kamille?

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.480
Char shouldn't be
a member of the A.E.U.G.!

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:48.480
What's all the commotion?!

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.920
- One of our men is injured!
- I won't fall for that!

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:52.720
It's because Char betrayed us!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.260
- Lieutenant!
- Are you one of Zeon's men?

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:57.120
That's Kamille's imagination!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:58.620
Stop it!

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.120
Hey, get a doctor!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.490
- Stop it!
- You can't blame him for his remarks!

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:05.490
Stop standing around and do something!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.200
Be patient. A doctor will be here
right away.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.540
Bastard!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.070
Mr. Wong! Not now!

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:16.480
Hey, Newtype, you can stop acting now.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.210
Lieutenant!

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.640
Kamille, is it true?!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.740
Of course it is.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.220
- Kamille.
- Drop your gun!

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:25.720
Mr. Wong, you're being rash!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.850
Negotiations have been broken off!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.150
If we remain confined here,
we'll end up getting killed!

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.490
I sure hope I wasn't hit around
for nothing, Captain.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.820
However, is it possible
to get out of the Gwadan?

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.900
That's what Lt. Quattro is finding out.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:40.940
We should follow!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:50.010
- How are Shinta and Qum?
- They've finally fallen asleep.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.840
Babysitting those two isn't an easy job.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.850
Is that ship supposed to be moving?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.410
We're keeping pace with them.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.420
They're having quite a long
welcoming party.

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.350
I'll go and look for Lieutenant Quattro.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.550
- But...!
- Let her go.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.590
They might relax their guard
if it's a woman.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.920
Please let me go, too.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.490
You were really hit
by the Lieutenant, weren't you?

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:12.530
It's too dangerous for Miss Reccoa
to go out there alone.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.160
All right. I'll set a time limit
of fifteen minutes.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.470
- We'll meet at the deck.
- Okay.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.870
Where's Haman Karn?!

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:40.960
Why do you keep getting yourself into
these dangerous situations, Miss Reccoa?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.560
It's my nature.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.620
- Is that all?
- Yes.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.200
- Miss Mineva.
- I'm scared! I'm so scared!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:52.100
- Someone's coming here to hurt me!
- I don't think so.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.840
There are many soldiers here
to protect you.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.080
Get me Haman.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.910
Haman! Please get her!

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:01.310
Call Haman to come here!

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.980
Miss Mineva's cowardice
is a problem.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:08.920
Haman Karn!

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.320
Char!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.990
Haman Karn! I'm taking your life!

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.460
So you <i>are</i> betraying us, Char.

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:21.890
I have never even once
betrayed anyone, Haman.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.770
I'm disappointed in you.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.140
I sent you to observe the Earth Sphere...

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.340
...because of your exploits during
the One Year War.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:32.740
You can't win alone within the Gwadan.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.620
Pathetic.

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:42.860
Lieutenant!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:48.800
Ensign!

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.190
Stop!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.000
- Kamille!
- Lieutenant Quattro!

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:56.800
You're always so level-headed;
what's happened?!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:59.500
Why don't you try to get out of here
right away?!

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.250
You're right.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.310
Can you move on, Ensign Reccoa?

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.550
- It only grazed me.
- Wait.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:19.820
Let's hurry!

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.300
Wait!

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:22.590
We must stop the bleeding first.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.970
I understand why you were upset.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.770
But it was a mistake to confront her
in here...

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:39.340
...even though I understand your differences
in principle with Haman Karn.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.880
We don't have time for such talk!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.010
Guard the entrance!

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.520
Right!

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.620
I can't blame Kamille for what he says.

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:51.450
But I couldn't help myself after seeing
that woman, Haman Karn...

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.460
...induce Mineva Zabi to act that way.

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:58.120
So reviving the Zabi Family isn't within
your objectives, Lieutenant?

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:00.230
I have nothing to do with the Zabi Family.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.340
I was an independent man at all times!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:05.840
Independent at all times?

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.700
There they are!

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.020
Kamille!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:25.160
I'll dash to the launch! Please cover me!

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.560
- You won't make it!
- I'll make it!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:34.330
Apolly!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.540
Captain Bright! It's me!

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:46.740
Lieutenant Quattro!

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.050
Lieutenant!
Where are Kamille and Reccoa?!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.080
Here, with me!

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:03.950
- Start it!
- Kamille's releasing the airlock!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.910
It's the launch!
I can see fire from the Gwadan!

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.140
Something's going on there!

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:16.910
Get cannons ready!

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:19.040
Use dummies! Send out balloons!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.440
Balloons?

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.570
They're dummies shaped like meteorites.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:23.780
Prepare to fight the battleship!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.020
Send out more dummies?

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.250
Could everyone be returning?

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.320
We're battling an enemy ship!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:37.060
Send out mobile suits!
Prepare to bring in the launch!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:38.620
Saegusa! The Argama's to retreat!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.670
Not all at once!
Mr. Saegusa's doing what you asked!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.800
- Where are you going?!
- To bring in the launch!

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:46.870
What about the dummies?

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:56.310
The envoys we were holding
have all escaped.

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:58.050
Damn Char!

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:02.080
- We have the Argama in sight, right?
- Actually, with so many dummies...!

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:04.590
Dummy balloons?!

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:07.780
Darn that Argama.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.020
They're disturbing both our vision
and radar.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:15.500
Kamille! Prepare to sortie in the Zeta!

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:16.540
Yes, sir!

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:17.670
Ensign Reccoa!

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:19.370
Get me a doctor!

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.310
I should have someone treat my injury...

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.110
...while I'm changing
my normal suit, right?

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.810
Then I'll go out!

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.180
- This is no time for jokes!
- Ensign.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.180
All gun platforms,
prepare for battle!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.180
Okay.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.910
Enemy mobile suits will be on their way!

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:33.960
Right!

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.560
If Lieutenant Quattro
hadn't acted so foolishly...!

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:39.590
No, we likely would've ended up
the same way.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:45.190
Lt. Quattro appears to be acting normal
now that he's returned to the Argama.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.330
<i>Char Aznable.</i>

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:53.500
<i>He must have realized our soldiers</i>
<i>are nothing but amateurs.</i>

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:56.040
Mobile suits approaching
from ten degrees portside!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.880
But they're not on their way to attack us!

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.710
They're headed for the Argama.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.580
Shall I have our mobile suit team
prepare to sortie?

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.120
Let them prepare.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.710
But I doubt that we'll need
to send them out.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.160
R-Right.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.520
Enemy mobile suits
approaching from fore, portside!

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:14.390
How many?!

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:16.400
Ten to thirteen.

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:23.230
I saw a flash. Can you tell, Dunkel?

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:24.800
Yes.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:28.540
Looks like there was a dispute between
the Argama and the unknown battleship.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:29.700
<i>That's very good.</i>

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.580
<i>What about you, Ramsus?</i>

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:36.370
We're already using the Spider Web in
actual battle without a trial run?

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.880
You're very demanding, Leader Yazan.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.010
<i>Don't say that.</i>

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:41.450
<i>It's better than staying put at Gryps,</i>
<i>don't you think?</i>

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:44.520
<i>I'm quite honored that you called upon me.</i>

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:47.190
<i>The Spider Web will only work</i>
<i>the first time. Get it right.</i>

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:48.020
<i>Roger.</i>

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:49.890
Zeta, we've got a gift for you.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.000
Just as I figured.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.940
Talks between the A.E.U.G. and Axis
have broken off.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.780
The luck of these times
is beginning to favor us.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:14.920
Ensign Reccoa!

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:17.260
- Are you sure about this?!
- <i>Don't worry about me!</i>

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.090
<i>There are a lot of enemy units out there!</i>

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.090
Roger!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:20.890
Kamille, taking off!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.290
It still hurts.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.600
<i>Will you be okay?</i>
<i>Want Fa to take your place?</i>

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:30.970
No! Reccoa, taking off!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.810
Th-They're fast!

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:49.150
Ensign Reccoa!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.760
Here comes the Zeta Gundam!

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:54.520
Dunkel, Ramsus, come here!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.560
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.900
They're escaping?!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.770
Kamille!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:10.070
What is it? Why are they flying together?

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.010
What?!

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:21.990
- Okay, switch on the electric current.
- <i>Right.</i>

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.230
- Is this really the Zeta Gundam?
- Hardly what it's rumored to be!

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.370
Kamille!

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.380
Sorry, Leader, but I'll be the one
to finish the Zeta Gundam.

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:49.040
I'm going to be killed.
In a place like this.

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.620
Can you move, Kamille?!

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:06.070
Damn it.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:12.900
<i>Let go! I'm telling you to let go!</i>

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.070
It's not him.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:16.740
Who is this?!

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.350
I can't stand the sight of women
on a battlefield!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:30.920
Vanish!

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:43.170
More enemies!

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:49.470
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.110
Thank you.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:54.180
<i>That pilot...!</i>

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.710
This is it!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:03.960
What?!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.250
The Mk. II?

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.960
All units, retreat!
We're returning to the Dogosse Gier!

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:12.800
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.960
The Mk. II.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.840
So the Radish came to our rescue.

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.180
Emma Sheen and Katz.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:56.770
<i>He's no longer around.</i>
<i>He's retreated to the Dogosse Gier.</i>

00:20:58.050 --> 00:20:59.640
<i>There he is!</i>

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:05.110
That's one of ours.

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:19.130
Miss Mineva. I, Paptimus Scirocco...

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.900
...am at your service...

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.870
...even if it means
laying down my life to do so.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.840
Very well, Paptimus Scirocco.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:32.210
You shall offer me your life for my good.

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:33.840
Thank you.

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:35.880
It is of the greatest honor.

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:40.380
<i>The world also has clowns like this man.</i>

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:43.080
<i>This world isn't all bad after all.</i>

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:53.400
Fa!

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.130
I'm so glad!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.830
You're all right, Kamille!

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.270
Of course I am!

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:15.990
<i>This awkward battle.</i>

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:18.920
<i>That woman beguiles me.</i>

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:23.920
<i>Haman Karn. Zeon's ghost.</i>

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:29.030
This incident marked the failure of
the A.E.U.G. to form ties with Axis.

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:31.000
From this point...

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:36.270
...the A.E.U.G. must contend with the united
strength of Zeon and the Titans.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:51.150
Reccoa finds what she was looking for
among the enemy.

00:23:51.590 --> 00:23:54.650
Nobody knows whether this will make
her miserable or not.

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:59.420
Kamille blames Char for the incident,
but nonetheless...

00:23:59.490 --> 00:24:01.890
...Reccoa of the Argama has died.

00:24:02.360 --> 00:24:06.960
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"The Call of Darkness".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
The Call of Darkness

00:24:07.730 --> 00:24:10.200
You will see the tears of time.
